Hoarfrost now has additional effects:

*  if friendly: magical and physical saves increased by [10, 16, 21, 26, 30 (TL1-5)], at level 5 healing factor is also increased by 15%.
*  if hostile: magical and physical saves reduced by [10, 16, 21, 26, 30 (TL1-5)], at level 5 all talents cool down 15% slower.
